SysPharmacy 1.0.0 for Linux
---------------------------
---------------------------

SysPharmacy is a example of a pharmacy sales system for Linux

SysPharmacy 2025 zyz7

The main features of SysPharmacy:

- It is an application that has user registration and login.

- Simulates a pharmacy system where employees, customers, products,
suppliers, categories, purchases and sales can be managed.

- It has options to list all sales and purchases and by creating each
of these transactions you can print these movements.

- It has two different user roles, administrator and staff,
the first can perform any task, the second has some options blocked,
for example making purchases.

SysPharmacy is free software distributed under the Mit License.
Read License.txt for more information about license.

This distribution package contains the following files:

  bin         - contains the executable file
  lib         - contains the necessary libraries
  readme.txt  - this file
  License.txt - license information


Installation
============

Open the /bin folder, from this location open the terminal and
type

./SysPharmacy

and enter, example credentials to enter are:

user:     prueba01
password: prueba01!


